  "reflectionText": "Nehemiah answered the enemies four times: I am doing a great work, so that I cannot come down. The wall was finished in fifty-two days. The nations around them were greatly cast down in their own eyes. What is the encouragement of saying the same answer four times to the same question, until the work is finally done?"
